      "title": "Q: Why is `//evil.com` dangerous?",
      "seconds": 90,
      "answerMarkdown": "**A:** Browsers treat **`//host`** as **scheme-relative**-same **scheme** **as** **current** **page** **but** **attacker** **host**. **Naive** **\"starts** **with** **`/`\"** **checks** **fail**."
    },
    {
      "id": "pcfdcd1b851fef2",
