      "title": "Q: Relative-only redirects\u2014safe?",
      "seconds": 90,
      "answerMarkdown": "**A:** **Safer** if you **enforce** **leading** **`/`**, **reject** **`//`**, **normalize** **path**, and **forbid** **`\\`** **and** **encoded** **variants** **per** **your** **framework**.\n\n---"
    },
